  "goodToKnow": "Die Keramik is ceramics or pottery: eine Vase aus Keramik, die Keramikfliese (ceramic tile). Making pottery is töpfern, and der Töpfer is a potter; Töpferkurse are a popular hobby. Germany's fine ceramic tradition includes Meissen porcelain, the first European hard-paste Porzellan, made from 1710. From Greek keramos (clay). It's stressed on the second syllable: ke-RAA-mik. Plural: die Keramiken."
